dates rust_function v1
description "A date whose alias has two underscores in a row. rustc's lint non_snake_case warns of its function, so the Rust code and the Wasm module do not build with -D warnings (W001). Every other target takes it as it is"

inputs
  ordered : date  range >=2026-01-01 <=2026-01-31

date ship__by = ordered
  + 3 days
